       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. LEAP.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
         01 WS-YEAR PIC 9(4).
         01 WS-RESULT PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
         01 WS-TEMP PIC 9(4).
         01 WS-REM PIC 9(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       LEAP.
         DIVIDE WS-YEAR BY 4 GIVING WS-TEMP REMAINDER WS-REM
         IF WS-REM = 0 THEN
            MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT
         ELSE 
            MOVE 0 TO WS-RESULT
         END-IF
         DIVIDE WS-YEAR BY 100 GIVING WS-TEMP REMAINDER WS-REM
         IF WS-REM = 0 THEN
            MOVE 0 TO WS-RESULT
         END-IF
         DIVIDE WS-YEAR BY 400 GIVING WS-TEMP REMAINDER WS-REM
         IF WS-REM = 0 THEN
            MOVE 1 TO WS-RESULT
         END-IF
         CONTINUE.
       LEAP-EXIT.
         EXIT.
